<title>ITALY: ATHLETICS-RIBEIRO OUT OF WORLD CROSS CHAMPIONSHIPSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-RIBEIRO OUT OF WORLD CROSS CHAMPIONSHIPSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic gold medallist Fernanda Ribeiro will not compete in Sunday's cross-country world championships because of injury, Portuguese team officials said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Ribeiro, who won the 10,000 metres at last year's Atlanta Olympics, did not arrive with the Portuguese squad on Friday. The officials did not disclose the nature of the injury and did not say when it occurred.</p>
</text>
